{0}</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="StatusPackage">Diagnostic package created: {0}. Attach it to your bug report. The recording is off again.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="StatusRenderDoc">RenderDoc is open with the game filled in: "Launch" starts it.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="PixHowTo">PIX is starting. The game's path is on the clipboard:
{0}

In PIX: "Select Target Process" › "Launch Win32" › paste it into "Path to executable" (Ctrl+V) › "Launch". In the game, "Print Screen" captures a frame.</sys:String>
